# NAME: AppleService
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule (.lsr)
# DESC: 港澳可用、大陸不穩嘅 Apple（新聞、TV+、試聽／直播、TestFlight、國際地圖瓦片）→ Default。更新／CDN／mask／推送／iCloud 喺 Direct。Siri ChatGPT relay 喺 AI
# 建議策略: 🚀 Default
# UPDATED: 2026-11-07 (Asia/Hong_Kong)
# TOTAL: 28
# SOURCES:
#   - github.com/tszchun0915/Clash (你原本嘅 Clash 規則) AppleService.yaml
#   - github.com/tszchun0915/Shadowrocket (你原本嘅 Shadowrocket 規則) AppleService.list
#   - v2fly domain-list-community data/apple-tvplus、data/itunes（@cn 留 Direct）
# CHANGELOG:
#   - 2026-11-07：Default 只留國際媒體／新聞／TestFlight／三條國際地圖瓦片。更新 CDN、mask.*、17.0.0.0/8 搬去 Direct；刪除 Maps／App Store USER-AGENT。唔加 gspe1-ssl、apple-relay、ls.apple.com 後綴、apple.com 後綴
# 主配置：AI 之後、Direct 之前（Direct 含 17.0.0.0/8）

# # App Store / iTunes（下載 CDN mzstatic 喺 Direct）
DOMAIN,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN,buy.itunes.apple.com

# # TestFlight
DOMAIN,beta.apple.com
DOMAIN,testflight.apple.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,testflight

# # News / TV+ / 無大陸節點嘅媒體
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appletv.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tv.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,applemusic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.comscoreresearch.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hls.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,uts-api.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,tv.applemusic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-assets.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-client.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-events.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client-search.apple.com
DOMAIN,video-ssl.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,itsliveradio.apple.com
DOMAIN,aodp-ssl.apple.com
DOMAIN,blobstore.apple.com
DOMAIN,cvws.icloud-content.com

# # 國際地圖瓦片（大陸瓦片 *-cn-ssl 唔喺呢度）
DOMAIN,gsp-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN,gspe12-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN,gspe19-ssl.ls.apple.com
